        "checksum": "6bee556eb90a8aa5608dbcbf334c14f82aa6cf65b43141c5ba8da810c04220db_1_1_1_0__1",
        "g6nPbfqnm9J_text": "“I have only been using it for a month. Prior to using this my skin was flaky &amp; dry. My skin barrier has been severely damaged for the past 2 years where almost anything I use burns, but in 1 month this mask has lightened my hyperpigmentation considerably as well as helped to give a bit.”",
        "gByNzh1QSXS_text": "“I was very skeptical when my husband bought this mask for me. But after 6mo the results are amazing!! I’ve tried numerous serums for my sun spots but nothing worked until I used this mask. Definitely worth the money.”",
        "gG0d9FJWlHG_text": "IT REALLY WORKS!!",
        "gNtFEu9ipQ0_text": "“My Novalight mask has been amazing! As someone who struggles with acne and rosacea, your LED light therapy mask has improved my skin so much that I can now feel comfortable without any makeup. I’m very happy with this product!”",
        "gWm1JWIF5v0_text": "Renewed Skin!",
        "gcpvBiQd2u1_text": "Aimee. | Verified Customer",
        "gg-YUumrX_6_text": "Renewed Skin!",
        "gg4_K8E6fbx_text": "“I have only been using it for a month. Prior to using this my skin was flaky &amp; dry. My skin barrier has been severely damaged for the past 2 years where almost anything I use burns, but in 1 month this mask has lightened my hyperpigmentation considerably as well as helped to give a bit.”",
        "ggEFMOK9dJg_text": "“My Novalight mask has been amazing! As someone who struggles with acne and rosacea, your LED light therapy mask has improved my skin so much that I can now feel comfortable without any makeup. I’m very happy with this product!”",
